;; with the REPL focused, so the value is deselected. :height is the item's height
;; in cells; :price and :currency are the listing the owner read off the overlay.
;; live-*: the shop 3 hard gate, 2026-11-26, one item's two reads through
;; :shop/read-overlay {:save-frames? true} with the game focused. -open has the
;; value selected (:selected? true: the read only locates the button on it);
;; -read is deselected, with the text caret after the value.
